module bankr-kyw-local-rules.local-rules

import core.states.kentucky.{ frbp9006-kentucky }

// The Bankr. W.D. Ky. court's own periods, counted under FRBP 9006(a), the
// FRCP 6(a) method: the Local Rules effective December 1, 2025. The FRBP
// periods (schedules, claims, the chapter 13 plan, discharge,
// dischargeability, the adversary answer, appeals) are lit/frbp's and are
// not declared again. Stated in the rules but not declared: the court's own
// acts (the patient care ombudsman order within 30 days of the commencement
// of a health care case, W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2007-1); the clock-time rule that
// a filing is timely if completed before midnight Eastern time (9006-1);
// the periods of the rules' own conditions (90 days of insurance coverage
// from the meeting of creditors, 4070-1(a)(3)-(5), (b)(2)); and the
// requirement that schedules and statements be signed no more than 14 days
// before they are filed (1007-1(a)), which bounds the date of signature
// rather than runs a period to an act. The 14-day period to file a petition
// after its execution (1002-1(a)) is declared; a petition filed later is
// cured by an amendment instead.
/// The debtor signs and dates the petition (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1002-1(a)).
event PetitionExecuted()
/// Notice of conversion of a chapter 11 or chapter 12 case to chapter 7 is
/// given (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1019(b)).
event ConversionNoticed()
/// Notice of conversion of a chapter 13 case to chapter 7 is given (W.D.
/// Ky. L.B.R. 1019(c)).
event Chapter13ConversionNoticed()
/// A Subchapter V trustee is appointed (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1094-1(b)).
event SubchapterVTrusteeAppointed()
/// The debtor's stipulated motion to approve an agreed monthly postpetition
/// deposit is served (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1094-1(b)(2)).
event DepositStipulationServed()
/// After confirmation of a nonconsensual Subchapter V plan, the debtor
/// acquires significant property (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(a)(2)).
event AfterAcquiredPropertyAcquired()
/// The Subchapter V trustee files a monthly notice of post-confirmation
/// fees and expenses (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(a)(6)).
event TrusteeFeeNoticeFiled()
/// A Subchapter V plan is substantially consummated (W.D. Ky. L.B.R.
/// 1095-1(b)).
event SubstantialConsummation()
/// The debtor files the Notice of Substantial Consummation in a case
/// confirmed under § 1191(a) (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(c)(2)).
event SubstantialConsummationNoticeFiled()
/// The Subchapter V trustee files the Report of No Distribution or Final
/// Report (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(c)(3), (d)(3)).
event SubchapterVFinalReportFiled()
/// The disbursing agent files a notice of completion of payments under a
/// nonconsensual Subchapter V plan (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(d)(2)).
event PlanCompletionNoticeFiled()
/// A debtor commences a case as a health care business, 11 U.S.C. §
/// 101(27A) (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2007-1).
event HealthCareCaseCommenced()
/// The order confirming a chapter 11 plan in a case not under Subchapter V
/// is entered (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2081-1(a)).
event Chapter11ConfirmationOrderEntered()
/// The chapter 12 trustee serves the notice of plan completion and of the
/// need to request a discharge (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2082-1(a)).
event Chapter12CompletionNoticeServed()
/// The chapter 13 trustee serves the notice of plan completion and of the
/// debtor's need to request a discharge (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2083-1(a)).
event Chapter13CompletionNoticeServed()
/// The meeting of creditors in a chapter 13 case is held (W.D. Ky. L.B.R.
/// 3001-1(b)).
event MeetingOfCreditorsHeld()
/// The court enters an order granting relief from the automatic stay, other
/// than in a plan, confirmation order or plan modification (W.D. Ky. L.B.R.
/// 3001-1(c)).
event StayReliefGranted()
/// A creditor files a deficiency proof of claim in a chapter 12 or 13 case
/// (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3001-1(c)(2)(ii)).
event DeficiencyClaimFiled()
/// A chapter 12 or 13 deficiency claim is allowed (W.D. Ky. L.B.R.
/// 3001-1(c)(2)(iii)).
event DeficiencyClaimAllowed()
/// A chapter 13 plan is confirmed (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3070-1(b)).
event Chapter13PlanConfirmed()
/// A motion for relief from the automatic stay is filed in a chapter 7 case
/// (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 4001-1(d)).
event Chapter7StayMotionFiled()
/// The hearing the court sets on a chapter 13 motion to terminate, annul or
/// modify the stay is scheduled to be held (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 4001-1(e)).
event Chapter13StayHearingScheduled()
/// The trustee or a creditor requests proof of insurance against physical
/// damage and loss (W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 4070-1(a)).
event InsuranceProofRequested()
/// A party requests a complete copy of an excerpted attachment (W.D. Ky.
/// L.B.R. 5005-1(e)).
event CompleteAttachmentRequested()
/// The trustee files a report of no distribution (W.D. Ky. L.B.R.
/// 6007-1(a)).
event NoDistributionReportFiled()

/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1002-1(a)(1): a petition is filed within 14 days of its
/// execution, or else a properly executed amendment indicating the changes
/// since execution is filed.
deadline petition-execution-period: 14.days after PetitionExecuted() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1002-1(a)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1019(b): unless the court directs otherwise, within 14
/// days of the notice of conversion of a chapter 11 or 12 case to chapter
/// 7, the debtor in possession or the trustee serving at conversion files a
/// schedule of unpaid postpetition, preconversion debts.
deadline converted-postpetition-debts-period: 14.days after ConversionNoticed() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1019(b)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1019(c): unless the court directs otherwise, within 14
/// days of the notice of conversion of a chapter 13 case to chapter 7, the
/// debtor files a notice of unpaid postpetition debts and amended Schedules
/// I and J.
deadline converted-chapter13-filings-period: 14.days after Chapter13ConversionNoticed() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1019(c)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1094-1(b)(1): within 10 days after appointment of a
/// Subchapter V trustee, the debtor confers with the trustee about the
/// monthly postpetition deposit for administrative expenses.
deadline deposit-conference-period: 10.days after SubchapterVTrusteeAppointed() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1094-1(b)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1094-1(b)(2): a party in interest opposing the
/// stipulated deposit motion may object within 21 days after the date of
/// service.
deadline deposit-stipulation-objection-period: 21.days after DepositStipulationServed() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1094-1(b)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1094-1(b)(3): if no deposit agreement is reached, the
/// debtor files a motion for an expedited hearing on the deposit
/// immediately and no later than the close of the 10th day after the
/// Subchapter V trustee is appointed.
deadline deposit-motion-period: 10.days after SubchapterVTrusteeAppointed() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1094-1(b)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(a)(2): under a confirmed nonconsensual plan, the
/// debtor gives the Subchapter V trustee written notice of significant
/// after-acquired property within 30 days of acquiring it.
deadline after-acquired-property-notice-period: 30.days after AfterAcquiredPropertyAcquired() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(a)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(a)(6): if no objection to the Subchapter V
/// trustee's monthly fee notice is filed within 14 days of its filing, the
/// debtor promptly pays the balance.
deadline trustee-fee-notice-objection-period: 14.days after TrusteeFeeNoticeFiled() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(a)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(b): the debtor files and serves the Notice of
/// Substantial Consummation within 14 days following substantial
/// consummation (11 U.S.C. § 1183(c)).
deadline substantial-consummation-notice-period: 14.days after SubstantialConsummation() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(b)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(c)(2): in a consensual Subchapter V case, within
/// 90 days of the Notice of Substantial Consummation the trustee files a
/// final compensation application and the NDR or TFR.
deadline consensual-final-report-period: 90.days after SubstantialConsummationNoticeFiled() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(c)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(c)(3): within 30 days of the trustee's NDR or TFR
/// in a consensual case, the debtor files a motion for final decree.
deadline consensual-final-decree-motion-period: 30.days after SubchapterVFinalReportFiled() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(c)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(d)(2): in a nonconsensual Subchapter V case,
/// within 90 days of the notice of plan completion the trustee files a
/// final compensation application and the NDR or TFR.
deadline nonconsensual-final-report-period: 90.days after PlanCompletionNoticeFiled() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(d)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(d)(3): within 30 days of the trustee's NDR or TFR
/// in a nonconsensual case, the debtor files a motion for entry of
/// discharge and a motion for final decree.
deadline nonconsensual-discharge-motion-period: 30.days after SubchapterVFinalReportFiled() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 1095-1(d)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2007-1: the court orders a patient care ombudsman
/// appointed without a hearing within 30 days of commencement of a health
/// care case unless, within 21 days, a motion is filed for an order that
/// the appointment is not necessary.
deadline ombudsman-motion-period: 21.days after HealthCareCaseCommenced() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2007-1"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2081-1(a): unless the confirmation order provides
/// otherwise, the debtor in possession or plan proponent files the
/// Certification and Request for Entry of Final Decree (Local Form U)
/// within 60 days of entry of the order of confirmation; extendable on
/// motion for cause.
deadline final-decree-certification-period: 60.days after Chapter11ConfirmationOrderEntered() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2081-1(a)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2082-1(a)(2): a chapter 12 debtor files the
/// Certification of Plan Completion and Request for Discharge (Local Form
/// V) within 30 days of the trustee's notice; extendable on motion for
/// cause.
deadline chapter12-discharge-certification-period: 30.days after Chapter12CompletionNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2082-1(a)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2083-1(a)(2): a chapter 13 debtor files the
/// Certification of Plan Completion and Request for Discharge (Local Form
/// Q) within 30 days of the trustee's notice; extendable on motion for
/// cause.
deadline chapter13-discharge-certification-period: 30.days after Chapter13CompletionNoticeServed() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 2083-1(a)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3001-1(b): in a chapter 13 case, secured and priority
/// claims should be filed within 7 days preceding the meeting of creditors;
/// failure may delay distribution.
deadline secured-priority-claim-period: 7.days before MeetingOfCreditorsHeld() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3001-1(b)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3001-1(c)(1)-(3): a deficiency claim arising from
/// disposition of secured collateral is filed no later than 180 days
/// following the order granting relief from the stay (in chapter 7, and no
/// later than the final report); enlargeable only on motion within the 180
/// days for cause.
deadline deficiency-claim-period: 180.days after StayReliefGranted() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3001-1(c)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3001-1(c)(2)(ii): in a chapter 12 or 13 case, debtor's
/// counsel has 30 days from the filing of a deficiency proof of claim to
/// object; an untimely objection leaves the claim deemed allowed.
deadline deficiency-claim-objection-period: 30.days after DeficiencyClaimFiled() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3001-1(c)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3001-1(c)(2)(iii): following allowance of the deficiency
/// claim, debtor's counsel has 30 days to file a supplemental schedule of
/// allowed claims.
deadline supplemental-schedule-period: 30.days after DeficiencyClaimAllowed() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3001-1(c)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3070-1(b): proposed plan payments held in counsel's
/// escrow are paid to the chapter 13 trustee within 10 days after
/// confirmation of the plan.
deadline plan-payment-turnover-period: 10.days after Chapter13PlanConfirmed() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 3070-1(b)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 4001-1(d)(1): in a chapter 7 case, if no response to a
/// stay motion is filed within 14 days, the relief may be granted.
deadline chapter7-stay-response-period: 14.days after Chapter7StayMotionFiled() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 4001-1(d)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 4001-1(e)(4): in a chapter 13 case, the debtor has until
/// 7 days before the hearing to respond to a stay motion; if no response is
/// filed the relief is granted.
deadline chapter13-stay-response-period: 7.days before Chapter13StayHearingScheduled() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 4001-1(e)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 4070-1(a)(1)-(2): proof of insurance is furnished to the
/// trustee and the creditor within 10 days of a request; failure is
/// presumed to mean no insurance is in effect.
deadline insurance-proof-period: 10.days after InsuranceProofRequested() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 4070-1(a)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 5005-1(e): a party may request one who filed an excerpt
/// to provide a complete copy of the attachment within 7 days of receipt of
/// the request.
deadline complete-attachment-period: 7.days after CompleteAttachmentRequested() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 5005-1(e)"
/// W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 6007-1(a): property of the estate is deemed abandoned if
/// the trustee files a report of no distribution and no objection is filed
/// within 30 days from the report.
deadline no-distribution-objection-period: 30.days after NoDistributionReportFiled() counted_by frbp9006-kentucky cite "W.D. Ky. L.B.R. 6007-1(a)"
